### SEC1 — Zero Secrets
Never commit: API keys, DB credentials, JWT tokens, .pem/.key files, .env files. If detected → **tell user immediately**.

### SEC2 — Credential Protocol
Need credentials: ask user to choose: (a) env var, (b) direct input (session only), (c) placeholder. Never create .env or hardcode.

