## SECTION 18: NO-LITE DELIVERY STANDARD

Every deliverable must have ALL THREE:

| Component | Requirement |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Implementation** | Concrete algorithm or pseudocode. Not vague ideas. Code that runs. |
| **Tests** | Unit tests or evaluation protocol. Not "would test." Tests that pass. |
